    /// has opened (or focused an already-open window for) the
    /// document renderer for `path`. Response to
    /// [`FrontendRequest::OpenDocument`].
    DocumentOpened {
        path: String,
    },
    /// Response to [`FrontendRequest::Shutdown`] when the supplied
